Duyo's Onyx pack (@duyojs/duyo/onyx) is a port of Onyx, the Enyo 2 theme, to Duyo. The stylesheets in
lib/onyx/src/css and the images in lib/onyx/src/images are derived from the enyojs/onyx repository,
version 2.7.0 (https://github.com/enyojs/onyx), and the kinds follow the behaviour of its controls.
The images of `RowGroup`, `Header`, `Divider`, `DividerDrawer`, `ConfirmPrompt`, `Dialog`, `ModalDialog`,
`SlidingPane` and `GrabButton` (lib/onyx/src/images/webos-*.png) and styles come from the Onyx theme of
webOS's Enyo 1.0 (https://github.com/enyojs/enyo-1.0), also Apache-2.0 (the images are byte-identical to
the ones in the webOS SDK).
